-- Q4: second-hop deposit routes. Every tx 2026-08-07..2026-11-05 signed by an account that received a tx from the
-- core set (account set + n1-transit.near + n1-treasury; 2459 receivers from Q1, out/q4_signer_list.json) and sent
-- to an Intents deposit entry point: intents.near, wrap.near, or bridge-mng.near (the account that wraps native NEAR
-- arriving at fresh deposit addresses and ft_transfer_calls it to intents.near; seen in Q3).
